# CPP audit round 2: DSPTAP's message ID with no tape device (F1 on
# it). Read-only. Recreated from its captures (ids-dsptap-cmdentry,
# ids-dsptap) after the original was lost; probe-msgid-opt.tn and
# probe-msgid-more.tn do the same for DSPOPT and DSPTAPCTG.
wait "Main Menu"
timeout 30000
type call qcmd
key enter
wait "Command Entry"
type DSPTAP DEV(TAP01)
key enter
settle 3000
snap ids-dsptap-cmdentry
cursor 5 7
key f1
settle 2000
snap ids-dsptap
key f12
settle 2000
